{"3270430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Systemic War", "steam_appid": 3270430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/1d6ae7dbdd63b377cd604065086c889a.avif?t=1787832991\" width=794 height=119 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Systemic War</strong> is a <strong>modern grand strategy</strong> game where your strategic choices are tested in <strong>RTS battles</strong>, each one altering the course of the ongoing conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>any nation</strong> — for example the USA, China, Russia, Ukraine, Germany, Poland, or Turkey — and guide it through the turbulent years of <strong>2008 to 2025</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/5b4f86bef67843b74d0ec7cb7481aa31.poster.avif?t=1787832991\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/5b4f86bef67843b74d0ec7cb7481aa31.webm?t=1787832991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your nation in a dynamic world of modern geopolitics, where every decision can shift the balance of power.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/e7bc604d0d6a1cb504f94821bb3a26e8.avif?t=1787832991\" width=794 height=309 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/9aee06d5480b0732ab2c7616072e22f8.avif?t=1787832991\" width=794 height=119 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25+ hand-crafted maps</strong> where you’ll command your forces in dynamic RTS battles. Engage in tactical clashes across focal real-world locations such as Hostomel (Ukraine), Warsaw, Aleppo, Taiwan, and Guam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong> your military power on the grand strategy layer, and bring your best forces into the RTS battles that shape the outcome of the war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>150+ unique units</strong> are available to fight on modern battlefields. Adapt to the rapidly changing modern battlefield by investing in cutting-edge drone and <strong>electronic warfare</strong> technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/1f435ba040b406274599a89a8e94afdf.poster.avif?t=1787832991\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/1f435ba040b406274599a89a8e94afdf.webm?t=1787832991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/82434cd4ecdd801955466bb9ee77fd2e.avif?t=1787832991\" width=794 height=119 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No provinces. No abstract regions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our strategic map is grounded in the real rail and road networks connecting towns and cities across the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It’s a living infrastructure model, mirroring the transformations that defined the early 21st century.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infrastructure shapes both the economy in peacetime and the conduct of war — from logistics to the movement of armies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/d998318979e0040753758d2095b2d568.poster.avif?t=1787832991\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/d998318979e0040753758d2095b2d568.webm?t=1787832991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/1cbec19388159328ccbb53a195d76133.avif?t=1787832991\" width=794 height=119 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your nation's economy based on the modern <strong>IS-LM-BP</strong> <strong>economic model</strong>, balancing <strong>interest rate</strong>, <strong>GDP</strong>, and <strong>price levels</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape monetary policy and control the value of your currency on the global money market to profit from international trade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop industry and decide whether your country will become a raw material exporter, a manufacturer of intermediate goods, or a provider of advanced technologies. It’s up to you to define your position within the global supply chain and determine your influence on the international market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your path: turn your nation into an export powerhouse, invest abroad, or buy social prosperity on credit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/8c45ca701873be1df48b5e736eac19f1.poster.avif?t=1787832991\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/8c45ca701873be1df48b5e736eac19f1.webm?t=1787832991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/0e4b024aa4cd5027419dbd9d6dc68bd4.avif?t=1787832991\" width=794 height=119 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 150 unique military units</strong> are organized into realistically recreated tactical formations such as the Polish 1st Warsaw Armored Brigade, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >U.S. 3rd Airborne Brigade &quot;Rakkasans&quot;, Chinese 164th Marine Brigade, Turkish 70th Mechanized Brigade, and Russian 79th Guards Motor Rifle Regiment. Command <strong>iconic vehicles</strong> like the Leopard 2PL, T-90A, AH-64E Apache helicopter, and infantry fighting vehicles such as the Type 04 and PARS III. Support your tanks and infantry with the defining assets of modern warfare: <strong>reconnaissance</strong>, <strong>strike drones</strong>, and <strong>electronic warfare units</strong>. Test the effectiveness of various unit compositions across diverse battlefields — from open terrain to dense urban environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/77f0fa737d747e923fd7bb529f55dcd1.poster.avif?t=1787832991\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/77f0fa737d747e923fd7bb529f55dcd1.webm?t=1787832991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/266baf438c52224e134007ed4adb8e6b.avif?t=1787832991\" width=794 height=119 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in selected battles set in <strong>hand-crafted</strong>, <strong>authentic</strong> <strong>locations</strong> — flashpoints in Central-Eastern Europe, the Middle East, and Asia-Pacific. Attack or defend objectives you can recognize from the real world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Systemic War recreates over <strong>25 focal points from around the globe</strong>, complete with their distinctive architecture and landmarks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maneuver your units through authentic layouts of cities, roads, and bridges. Use the real topography and natural obstacles to gain a tactical advantage over your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/bd804ee5af92577923c5cc4be7b52a62.poster.avif?t=1787832991\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/bd804ee5af92577923c5cc4be7b52a62.webm?t=1787832991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/cbe0248664bfa475cf510bd859cf8506.avif?t=1787832991\" width=794 height=119 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heart of our diplomacy is <strong>conflict escalation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision can push it one step higher — from silent pressure to open war. Use <strong>hybrid actions</strong> to weaken your opponent or win the international community to your side. But don’t overplay your hand — an overly aggressive policy and humiliating a nuclear power may push the world to the brink of atomic annihilation, which means game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/b5b2b12b81e44424633eb1ba4e8abe73.poster.avif?t=1787832991\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/b5b2b12b81e44424633eb1ba4e8abe73.webm?t=1787832991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/bedb5fbd14774aa01f81ca18fc8cfa3a.avif?t=1787832991\" width=794 height=119 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through pivotal moments of modern history — both those that happened and those that could have. Understand how great power competition leads to conflict escalation — not through lectures or boring books, but through exciting gameplay. Experience world politics and war through stylized news reports, press conferences, and statements from real politicians - <strong>everything delivered as immersive video — no walls of text</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/251bde830716a318890b98aaa0840abb.poster.avif?t=1787832991\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/251bde830716a318890b98aaa0840abb.webm?t=1787832991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/af7bf55a2f1ba0a118f8cbb0aac251df.avif?t=1787832991\" width=794 height=119 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form and develop specialized <strong>research team</strong>s that allow you to conduct breakthroughs efficiently in their fields. Decide whether to upgrade existing weapon systems or invest in groundbreaking prototypes of the next generation. Civilian technologies matter as well — improvements in infrastructure, energy, and logistics strengthen the backbone of your nation. The key choice lies in balancing your own technology — <strong>enabling domestic production against reliance on imports and diplomatic dependencies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/11e205a3264a655f4d80355e7c8eeeba.poster.avif?t=1787832991\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/11e205a3264a655f4d80355e7c8eeeba.webm?t=1787832991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><