 poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/8c45ca701873be1df48b5e736eac19f1.poster.avif?t=1787832991\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/8c45ca701873be1df48b5e736eac19f1.webm?t=1787832991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/0e4b024aa4cd5027419dbd9d6dc68bd4.avif?t=1787832991\" width=794 height=119 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 150 unique military units</strong> are organized into realistically recreated tactical formations such as the Polish 1st Warsaw Armored Brigade, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >U.S. 3rd Airborne Brigade &quot;Rakkasans&quot;, Chinese 164th Marine Brigade, Turkish 70th Mechanized Brigade, and Russian 79th Guards Motor Rifle Regiment. Command <strong>iconic vehicles</strong> like the Leopard 2PL, T-90A, AH-64E Apache helicopter, and infantry fighting vehicles such as the Type 04 and PARS III. Support your tanks and infantry with the defining assets of modern warfare: <strong>reconnaissance</strong>, <strong>strike drones</strong>, and <strong>electronic warfare units</strong>. Test the effectiveness of various unit compositions across diverse battlefields — from open terrain to dense urban environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/77f0fa737d747e923fd7bb529f55dcd1.poster.avif?t=1787832991\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/77f0fa737d747e923fd7bb529f55dcd1.webm?t=1787832991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/266baf438c52224e134007ed4adb8e6b.avif?t=1787832991\" width=794 height=119 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in selected battles set in <strong>hand-crafted</strong>, <strong>authentic</strong> <strong>locations</strong> — flashpoints in Central-Eastern Europe, the Middle East, and Asia-Pacific. Attack or defend objectives you can recognize from the real world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Systemic War recreates over <strong>25 focal points from around the globe</strong>, complete with their distinctive architecture and landmarks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maneuver your units through authentic layouts of cities, roads, and bridges. Use the real topography and natural obstacles to gain a tactical advantage over your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/bd804ee5af92577923c5cc4be7b52a62.poster.avif?t=1787832991\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/bd804ee5af92577923c5cc4be7b52a62.webm?t=1787832991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/cbe0248664bfa475cf510bd859cf8506.avif?t=1787832991\" width=794 height=119 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heart of our diplomacy is <strong>conflict escalation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision can push it one step higher — from silent pressure to open war. Use <strong>hybrid actions</strong> to weaken your opponent or win the international community to your side. But don’t overplay your hand — an overly aggressive policy and humiliating a nuclear power may push the world to the brink of atomic annihilation, which means game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/b5b2b12b81e44424633eb1ba4e8abe73.poster.avif?t=1787832991\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/b5b2b12b81e44424633eb1ba4e8abe73.webm?t=1787832991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/bedb5fbd14774aa01f81ca18fc8cfa3a.avif?t=1787832991\" width=794 height=119 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through pivotal moments of modern history — both those that happened and those that could have. Understand how great power competition leads to conflict escalation — not through lectures or boring books, but through exciting gameplay. Experience world politics and war through stylized news reports, press conferences, and statements from real politicians - <strong>everything delivered as immersive video — no walls of text</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/251bde830716a318890b98aaa0840abb.poster.avif?t=1787832991\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/251bde830716a318890b98aaa0840abb.webm?t=1787832991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/af7bf55a2f1ba0a118f8cbb0aac251df.avif?t=1787832991\" width=794 height=119 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form and develop specialized <strong>research team</strong>s that allow you to conduct breakthroughs efficiently in their fields. Decide whether to upgrade existing weapon systems or invest in groundbreaking prototypes of the next generation. Civilian technologies matter as well — improvements in infrastructure, energy, and logistics strengthen the backbone of your nation. The key choice lies in balancing your own technology — <strong>enabling domestic production against reliance on imports and diplomatic dependencies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/11e205a3264a655f4d80355e7c8eeeba.poster.avif?t=1787832991\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270430/extras/11e205a3264a655f4d80355e7c8eeeba.webm?t=1787832991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Lead your nation in a modern grand strategy game (2008–2025), using a macroeconomic model with exchange rates, diplomacy, and hybrid warfare. Engage in kinetic warfare on the strategic map, then shift to RTS battles at focal points.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong><br><str